# Two files in BRANDING/ are deliberately not tracked:
#   - "White/rick douglas.jpg" is a personal staff portrait, not a brand asset,
#     and was misfiled into the logo-variant folder.
#   - the US Route 1 shield is a stock JPEG under its original marketplace
#     filename with no licence record, and is raster despite "vector" in the
#     name. Fort Kent being the northern terminus of US 1 is a good hook, but it
#     needs original artwork before it can be part of the brand.
# Remove these two lines if you want them versioned anyway.
BRANDING/White/rick douglas.jpg
BRANDING/White/us-route-1-sign-shield-*.jpg
